## Key Concepts

- Change Data Capture (CDC) at cloud scale
- Per-tenant data isolation and architecture
- Schema drift detection and automated validation
- Backward-compatible migration strategies
- Data Catalog contract enforcement
- DLP-based PII masking and data protection
- Data Exchange for secure partner publishing

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-logic: drift detection
function driftCheck(incomingSchema, currentSchema) {
  const changes = schemaDiff(incomingSchema, currentSchema);

  if (isBackwardCompatible(changes)) {
    generateMigration(changes);
    createSnapshot();
    applyMigration(changes);
  } else {
    alertSchemaViolation(changes);
  }
}
